  "note": "A 20 nm-long, flat-cut window through a reconstructed 14-protofilament GMPCPP microtubule lattice from PDB 6DPU. Alpha tubulin is teal and beta tubulin violet. Neighboring-protofilament and longitudinal transforms are fitted to matching deposited C-alpha coordinates. The seam is inferred; seam-specific conformations and disordered tails are unresolved. The generic 25 nm diameter is approximate; this in-vitro 14-protofilament example is wider than a common 13-protofilament cellular microtubule.",
